# Update from the template

How to take a new release of the template this game was rendered from,
`{{ template_url }}`. The page lists the seed files an update never touches, the managed
files it merges, the convention of appending game edits at the end of a block, the
conflicts to resolve, the recipes to run afterwards, the one hand edit the answers file
allows, and how to pin an update to a tag.
